+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, py3k
+    :tickets: 4291
+
+    Replaced the usage of inspect.formatargspec() with a vendored version
+    copied from the Python standard library, as inspect.formatargspec()
+    is deprecated and as of Python 3.7.0 is emitting a warning.
